    "detailed_description": "Doomsday Contact is a FPS tactical shooter game which allows you to be deployed in a operation as a special forces and fight the monsters and complete the objective for extraction. You must do what it takes to complete the mission and save the world!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game includes:<br />\r\n - Gun Customization <br />\r\n  <br />\r\n -Play offline without internet connection<br />\r\n <br />\r\n -Freely walk around the map <br />\r\n<br />\r\n -Choose your own way to complete the mission<br />\r\n<br />\r\n To talk to other people playing this game and keep up with it's development, make sure to join our Discord server!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n Discord link: https://discord.gg/U9eBuvwUua<br />\r\n<br />\r\nP.S. We are a two men indie game studio and have worked on this game for a while. It would be really great for us if you enjoy our game!",
